      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1907-12-14_WidnesExaminer_art0121" n="art0121">
        <head>WARRIN:.GTON Pro9f.</head>
        <p>WARRIN:.GTON Pro9f.</p>
        <p>"Every Picture Tells a Story."</p>
        <p>Do you suffer from shooting or continuous pains in the back ? Or from a heavy, dull, tired feeling: even when getting up in the</p>
        <p>morning? Or is your head continually aching? Or are you nervous, dizzy, with specks floating bef)re your eves or ringing in your ears? Is your appetite poor, or are you losing flesh? Have you ever suspected your kidneys? Sick or weak kidneys produce these symptoms. With every box of Doan's Backache Kidney Pills full information about kidney disease is given. Here ;s an example of a cure of kidney disease in Warrington.</p>
        <p>Cured to stay cured is the story of Mrs. Lucy Braban, 6, Pouch's-lane, Thelmall-lane, Latchford, Warrington, who said to a representative : --" I've not had the rheumatism return ; Doan's backache kidney pills made a permanent cure in my case. I am always pleased to recommend the medicine." It has nearly a year and a half after her cure that Mrs.Braban told our representative the above. The details of her case are given in her original statement, which is as follows : " The reason can speak well of Doan's backache kidney pills is because of the good they have done me. I used to be a grelt sufferer from,rheurnatism : it extended THE ONLY</p>
        <p>to all parts of my body,and then settled in the small of my back and round the loins, At times my back was s, bad that I could not get up out of a chair. I was almost unable to get across the room. My limbs swelled. I was treated by the doctor, but his medicine gave me no lasting relief. "I then determined to try your pills, and I soon found they were just what I needed. By the time the second box of the pills was finished people remarked how much better I was looking. Doan's backache kidney pills have brought me great benefit, and I have told others about them. (Signed) Lucy Braban."</p>
