      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1907-12-14_WidnesExaminer_art0122" n="art0122">
        <head>GENUINE</head>
        <p>GENUINE</p>
        <p>B X. /OF Be careful to get the genuine Doan's Backache Kidney Pills They cannot be bought loose. They may be obtained of all chemiqts and stores, or direct post free. from the Foster-McClellan Co., 8. Wells- street. Oxford-street. London, W., price as. yd. a box, or 13s. 9d. for 6 boxes.</p>
